  "doctrine": [],
  "note": "The place name Kibroth-hattaavah already belongs to qavar. The written form או in Proverbs 31:4 may represent desire, but the reading tradition points to the interrogative. The many ordinary occurrences of אוֹ “or” are a separate word. The relation of Evi’s name to desire is uncertain."
